        "subject": "Application Received | People Serve MPC",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><title>Application Received</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F2F5FA;font-family:Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#F2F5FA;padding:32px 12px;\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;width:100%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(31,79,163,0.10);\">\n<tr><td style=\"height:6px;line-height:6px;font-size:0;background-color:#1F4FA3;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#1F4FA3 0%,#2E8B3A 100%);\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 32px 8px 32px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:38px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;\"><span style=\"color:#2E8B3A;\">People</span> <span style=\"color:#1F4FA3;\">Serve</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#6B7280;margin-top:2px;\">Multi-purpose Cooperative</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 32px 0 32px;\">\n<span style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#E8F5EC;color:#2E8B3A;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;\">&#10003;&nbsp; Application Received</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 40px 8px 40px;color:#1F2937;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:#1F4FA3;\">{{ $('Normalize Extracted CV Fields').item.json.greeting_line }}</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">We have received your CV and application details. Our recruitment team will review your qualifications and experience.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 20px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background-color:#F2F5FA;border-left:4px solid #2E8B3A;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#374151;\">We aim to contact you within <strong style=\"color:#1F4FA3;\">24&ndash;48 hours</strong> regarding the next steps in the recruitment process.</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0;\">Thank you for your interest!</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">Best regards,<br><strong style=\"color:#1F4FA3;\">HR Recruitment Team</strong></p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 40px 0 40px;\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;\"></div></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:18px 40px 30px 40px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#9CA3AF;\">People Serve Multi-purpose Cooperative<br>This is an automated confirmation of your application.</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body></html>",
